'''Puffsley's Comet''' (超新星テッサー, ''Chōshinsei Tessā'', '''Supernova Tessar''') is an [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] variant of [[Mr. Puffington]] introduced in the [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] [[Puffer Planet (Merciless)|Blue Impact]]. He was added in [[Version 8.10 Update|Version 8.10]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Puffsley's Comet
|image = E 479.png
|first appearance = [[Puffer Planet (Merciless)|Blue Impact]]<br>
'''ZL''': [[Misfortune in Sand|Sub-chapter 7 - Misfortune in Sand]]
|money drop = 4,500¢ - 17,775¢
}}

==Enemy==
Puffsley's Comet behaves much like Mr. Puffington, but with higher stats befitting his status as an [[:Category:Advent Bosses|Advent Boss]]. The biggest difference between the two is that Puffsley's Comet has 50 more standing range and 150 more [[Omni Strike]] range, allowing his attack to hit many more cats. Instead of Curse, he inflicts Knockback, which tends to be a lesser ability, as his already heavy damage prevents it from having an impact outside of [[:Category:Tanker-class Cats|tankers]].

Since one pufferfish usually isn't as much of a threat later on, some of Puffsley's Comet's encounters up the ante with [[Mr. Puffington]], [[Puffzerker]] or more of himself, including [[Misfortune in Sand]], [[Snores and Prayers]], [[Round 1 (Pay Day)]] and [[Spiky Supercluster (Merciless)|Spiky Supercluster]].

